{"id":"0220bf5720935de514669b3226d35f47ba96ec6e","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/articles/apple-tests-chinas-cxmt-memory-120655649.html","title":"Apple tests China's CXMT memory chips for iPhones and MacBooks, WSJ reports","site_name":"Buzzing","source":"finance.yahoo.com","byline":"Reuters","excerpt":"Apple has been testing memory chips from China's ‌CXMT across product lines including ‌iPhones and MacBooks, to mitigate a component shortage ​fueled by the...","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"main-content-wrapper\">  <article data-testid=\"article-content-wrapper\">     <div><p>  Reuters </p> <p><time datetime=\"2026-08-09T12:06:55+00:00\" data-timestamp=\"2026-08-09T12:06:55+00:00\">Sun, August 9, 2026 at 5:06 AM PDT</time> <span>1 min read</span></p></div>   <div data-testid=\"article-body\">        <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Aug 9 (Reuters) - <a href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/organizations/apple/\" data-ylk=\"slk:Apple;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;Apple&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">Apple</a> has been testing memory chips from China's ‌CXMT across product lines including ‌iPhones and MacBooks, to mitigate a component shortage ​fueled by the AI boom, the Wall Street Journal reported on Sunday.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>        <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Apple held early talks with CXMT, which ‌is China's ⁠largest chipmaker by market value, about supplying components with ⁠the goal of using them in some devices sold in China, the ​report said, ​citing people ​familiar with the ‌matter.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>                 <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Reuters could not immediately verify the report. Apple and CXMT did not respond to Reuters' requests for comment.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>        <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Reuters had earlier exclusively reported that CXMT was considering ‌building a second memory-chip ​plant in Beijing ​to boost ​production.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>        <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Laptop makers HP and ‌Acer have started using ​CXMT memory ​chips in devices sold outside the U.S. to ease supply shortages, ​the ‌newspaper said.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>        <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->(Reporting by Shivani Tanna in ​Bengaluru; Editing by Alexander Smith ​and Barbara Lewis)<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>       </div> <span> </span> </article>      <section data-testid=\"related-content-fallback\"><header> </header>  <div data-testid=\"related-content-stream\"><ul>  <li><section data-testid=\"storyitem\" role=\"article\"><a data-ylk=\"elm:img;elmt:link;itc:0;source:related-content%20fltrd-strs;ct:story;slk:Apple%20tests%20CXMT%20Chinese%20memory%20chips%20for%20iPhones%2C%20MacBooks;pl2:related-content_fltrd-strs;destpartner:Quartz;sec:related-content;subsec:fltrd-strs;cpos:1;g:124bf6c7-0f6b-39c4-aa86-427145ecc3cb\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;img&quot;,&quot;yLinkElementType&quot;:&quot;link&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;related-content fltrd-strs&quot;,&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;Apple tests CXMT Chinese memory chips for iPhones, MacBooks&quot;,&quot;ySeamlessType&quot;:&quot;related-content_fltrd-strs&quot;,&quot;yDestinationContentPartner&quot;:&quot;Quartz&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;related-content&quot;,&quot;ySubModuleName&quot;:&quot;fltrd-strs&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:1,&quot;yDestinationContentUUID&quot;:&quot;124bf6c7-0f6b-39c4-aa86-427145ecc3cb&quot;}\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/articles/apple-tests-cxmt-chinese-memory-132557659.html\" aria-label=\"Apple tests CXMT Chinese memory chips for iPhones, MacBooks\" title=\"Apple tests CXMT Chinese memory chips for 