ncluding ‌iPhones and MacBooks, to mitigate a component shortage ​fueled by the AI boom, the Wall Street Journal reported on Sunday. Apple held early talks with CXMT, which ‌is China's ⁠largest chipmaker by market value, about supplying components with ⁠the goal of using them in some devices sold in China, the ​report said, ​citing people ​familiar with the ‌matter. Reuters could not immediately verify the report. Apple and CXMT did not respond to Reuters' requests for comment. Reuters had earlier exclusively reported that CXMT was considering ‌building a second memory-chip ​plant in Beijing ​to boost ​production. Laptop makers HP and ‌Acer have started using ​CXMT memory ​chips in devices sold outside the U.S. to ease supply shortages, ​the ‌newspaper said. (Reporting by Shivani Tanna in ​Bengaluru; Editing by Alexander Smith ​and Barbara Lewis)","fetched_at":"2026-08-11T14:29:40.859Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<p>  Reuters </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Reuters","zh":"路透社"}]},{"html_en":"<p><time datetime=\"2026-08-09T12:06:55+00:00\" data-timestamp=\"2026-08-09T12:06:55+00:00\">Sun, August 9, 2026 at 5:06 AM PDT</time> <span>1 min read</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Sun, August 9, 2026 at 5:06 AM PDT 1 min read","zh":"太平洋夏令时间 2026 年 8 月 9 日星期日凌晨 5:06 阅读 1 分钟"}]},{"html_en":"<p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Aug 9 (Reuters) - <a href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/organizations/apple/\" data-ylk=\"slk:Apple;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;Apple&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">Apple</a> has been testing memory chips from China's ‌CXMT across product lines including ‌iPhones and MacBooks, to mitigate a component shortage ​fueled by the AI boom, the Wall Street Journal reported on Sunday.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Aug 9 (Reuters) - Apple has been testing memory chips from China's ‌CXMT across product lines including ‌iPhones and MacBooks, to mitigate a component shortage ​fueled by the AI boom, the Wall Street Journal reported on Sunday.","zh":"路透 8 月 9 日 - 据《华尔街日报》周日报道，苹果一直在 iPhone 和 MacBook 等产品线中测试中国长鑫存储的存储芯片，以缓解人工智能热潮引发的零部件短缺问题。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Apple held early talks with CXMT, which ‌is China's ⁠largest chipmaker by market value, about supplying components with ⁠the goal of using them in some devices sold in China, the ​report said, ​citing people ​familiar with the ‌matter.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Apple held early talks with CXMT, which ‌is China's ⁠largest chipmaker by market value, about supplying components with ⁠the goal of using them in some devices sold in China, the ​report said, ​citing people ​familiar with the ‌matter.","zh":"报道援引知情人士的话称，苹果与长鑫存储（按市值计算，中国最大的芯片制造商）就供应零部件事宜进行了早期谈判，目标是在中国销售的部分设备中使用这些零部件。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Reuters could not immediately verify the report. Apple and CXMT did not respond to Reuters' requests for comment.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Reuters could not immediately verify the report.","zh":"路透社无法立即核实该报道。"},{"en":"Apple and CXMT did not respond to Reuters' requests for comment.","zh":"苹果和长鑫存储没有回应路透社的置评请求。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Reuters had earlier exclusively reported that CXMT was considering ‌building a second memory-chip ​plant in Beijing ​to boost ​production.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Reuters had earlier exclusively reported that CXMT was considering ‌building a second memory-chip ​plant in Beijing ​to boost ​production.","zh":"路透社早些时候独家报道称，长鑫存储正在考虑在北京建设第二座存储芯片工厂以提高产量。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Laptop makers HP and ‌Acer have started using ​CXMT memory ​chips in devices sold outside the U.S. to ease supply shortages, ​the ‌newspaper said.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Laptop makers HP and ‌Acer have started using ​CXMT memory ​chips in devices sold outside the U.S. to ease supply shortages, ​the ‌newspaper said.","zh":"该报称，笔记本电脑制造商惠普和宏碁已开始在美国境外销售的设备中使用 CXMT 内存芯片，以缓解供应短缺。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->(Reporting by Shivani Tanna in ​Bengaluru; Editing by Alexander Smith ​and Barbara Lewis)<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>","sentences":[{"en":"(Reporting by Shivani Tanna in ​Bengaluru; Editing by Alexander Smith ​and Barbara Lewis)","zh":"（Shivani Tanna 班加罗尔报道；亚历山大·史密斯和芭芭拉·刘易斯编辑）"}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"main-content-wrapper\">  <article data-testid=\"article-content-wrapper\">     <div><p>路透社</p> <p>太平洋夏令时间 2026 年 8 月 9 日星期日凌晨 5:06 阅读 1 分钟</p></div>   <div data-testid=\"article-body\">        <p>路透 8 月 9 日 - 据《华尔街日报》周日报道，苹果一直在 iPhone 和 MacBook 等产品线中测试中国长鑫存储的存储芯片，以缓解人工智能热潮引发的零部件短缺问题。</p>        <p>报道援引知情人士的话称，苹果与长鑫存储（按市值计算，中国最大的芯片制造商）就供应零部件事宜进行了早期谈判，目标是在中国销售的部分设备中使用这些零部件。</p>                 <p>路透社无法立即核实该报道。 苹果和长鑫存储没有回应路透社的置评请求。</p>        <p>路透社早些时候独家报道称，长鑫存储正在考虑在北京建设第二座存储芯片工厂以提高产量。</p>        <p>该报称，笔记本电脑制造商惠普和宏碁已开始在美国境外销售的设备中使用 CXMT 内存芯片，以缓解供应短缺。</p>        <p>（Shivani Tanna 班加罗尔报道；亚历山大·史密斯和芭芭拉·刘易斯编辑）</p>       </div> <span> </span> </article>      <section data-testid=\"related-content-fallback\"><header> </header>  <div data-testid=\"related-content-stream\"><ul>  <li><section data-testid=\"storyitem\" role=\"article\"><a data-ylk=\"elm:img;elmt:link;itc:0;source:related-content%20fltrd-strs;ct:story;slk:Apple%20tests%20CXMT%20Chinese%20memory%20chips%20for%20iPhones%2C%20MacBooks;pl2:related-content_fltrd-strs;destpartner:Quartz;sec:related-content;subsec:fltrd-strs;cpos:1;g:124bf6c7-0f6b-39c4-aa86-427145ecc3cb\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;img&quot;,&quot;yLinkElementType&quot;:&quot;link&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;related-content fltrd-strs&quot;,&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&